hadiths[64]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bani Mustaliq par hamla kiya jabke wo ghafil they, jabke un ke maweshi pani par pilaye ja rahe they. Phir Aap ne un ke ladne walon ko qatl kiya, un ki aulad ko qaidi banaya. Aur us din Juwayriya ko paya. Aur Abdullah bin Umar us lashkar mein they."
"1130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa aur Muadh se Sa'id bin Abi Burda ke hawale se un ke walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke dada Abu Musa aur Muadh ko Yemen ki taraf bheja. To Aap ne farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo. Khush-khabri do, nafrat na dilao. Aur baham muwafiqat karo."
"1131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo. Khush-khabri do, nafrat na dilao."
"1132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ahad-shikan ke liye Qayamat ke din jhanda nasb kiya jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Ye falan bin falan ki ahad-shikani hai."
"1133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har ahad-shikan ke liye Qayamat ke din jhanda hoga, Qayamat ke din nasb kiya jayega jis se wo pehchana jayega."
"1134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jang fareb hai."
"1135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jang ko fareb kaha."
"1136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Dushman se milne ki tamanna na karo. Phir jab tum un se milo to sabr karo."
"1137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ko likha jab wo Haruriya ki taraf nikle: Ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne un dino mein se ek din jin mein Aap dushman se mile, intezar farmate yahan tak ke suraj dhal jata. Phir logon mein khade hote aur farmate: Ae logon! Dushman se milne ki tamanna na karo. Aur Allah se aafiyat mango. Phir jab tum un se milo to sabr karo. Aur jano ke Jannat talwaron ke sayon ke neeche hai. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Kitab nazil karne wale, badal chalane wale, girohon ko shikast dene wale! Unhe shikast de aur un par hamari madad farma."
"1138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki kuchh ladaiyon mein ek aurat payi gayi jo qatl ki gayi thi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aurton aur bachchon ke qatl ka inkar farmaya."
"1139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'b bin Jaththama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas se Abwa ya Waddan mein guzre. Aur Aap se ghar walon ke bare mein poochha gaya jo mushrikon mein se raat mein gher liye jayein aur un ki aurton aur aulad mein se musibat pahunche. Aap ne farmaya: Wo un mein se hain."
"1140","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bani Nadir ke khajoor jalaye aur kaate, jo Buwaira hai. Phir ye nazil hui [jo tum ne narm khajoor kaati ya use apni jadon par khada chhora to Allah ki ijazat se]."
"1141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ambiya mein se ek Nabi ne ladayi ki. Phir unhon ne apni qaum se kaha: Mere peechhe wo shakhs na aaye jo aurat ka mehr malik ho aur us se nikah karna chahta ho jabke us ne us se nikah na kiya ho. Na koi jis ne ghar banaye hon aur un ki chhatein unchi na ki hon. Na koi jis ne bakriyan ya hamla oontniyan khareedi hon jabke wo un ke janne ka intezar karta ho. Phir unhon ne ladayi ki. Phir basti ke qareeb pahunche Asr ki namaz ke waqt ya is ke qareeb. Phir unhon ne suraj se kaha: Beshak tum hukm di gayi ho aur main hukm diya gaya hun. Ae Allah! Use hum par rok de. Phir wo rok di gayi yahan tak ke Allah ne unhe fatah di. Phir unhon ne ghaneematein jama ki. Phir aag aayi [matlab Aag] taake use khaye. Phir us ne use na khaya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum mein khayanat hai. Phir har qabeelay mein se ek shakhs mujh se bai'at kare. Phir ek shakhs ka hath Aap ke hath se chipak gaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein khayanat hai. Phir tumhara qabeela mujh se bai'at kare. Phir do ya teen mardon ke hath Aap ke hath se chipak gaye. Phir Aap ne kaha [aur hadith mein baqi hissa hai]."
"1142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek lashkar bheja jis mein Abdullah they, Najd ki taraf. Phir unhon ne bahut se oont ghaneemat mein paye. Phir un ke hisse barah ya gyarah oont they. Aur unhe ek ek oont zyada diya gaya."
"1143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un lashkaron mein se kuchh ko jo Aap bhejte apne liye khaas zyada dete, aam lashkar ke hisse ke siwa."
"1144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Hunain ke saal nikle. Phir jab hum mile to Musalmanon ki pheri hui. Phir main ne mushrikon mein se ek shakhs ko dekha jo Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs par chadh gaya tha. Phir main ghooma yahan tak ke us ke peechhe aaya. Yahan tak ke main ne use talwar se us ke kandhe ki nas par mara. Phir wo meri taraf mutawajjah hua aur mujhe aise bheencha jis se main ne maut ki boo payi. Phir use maut ne pa liya aur us ne mujhe chhor diya. Phir main Umar bin al-Khattab se mila. Phir main ne kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ka hukm. Phir log laute. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jo maqtool qatl kare jis par us ke paas daleel ho to us ke liye us ka saman hai. Phir main khada hua aur kaha: Kaun mere liye gawahi dega? Phir baith gaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jo maqtool qatl kare jis par us ke paas daleel ho to us ke liye us ka saman hai. Phir main khada hua aur kaha: Kaun mere liye gawahi dega? Phir baith gaya. Phir Aap ne teesri martaba is jaisa farmaya. Phir ek shakhs ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha Ya Rasulullah! Aur us ka saman mere paas hai. Phir use mujh se raazi karo. Phir Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Nahi. Jab wo Allah ke sheron mein se ek sher ki taraf jaye jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye ladta hai, wo tumhe us ka saman dega? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Phir use de do. Phir main ne zirah bechi aur us se Bani Salima mein phal ka bagh khareeda. Aur beshak wo pehla maal hai jo main ne Islam mein jama kiya."
"1145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main Badr ke din saf mein khada tha to main ne apne dayein aur bayein dekha. Phir main Ansar ke do nau-umr ladkon ke paas tha. Main ne tamanna ki ke main un se zyada mazboot walon ke darmiyan hota. Phir un mein se ek ne mujhe kankocha. Phir us ne kaha: Ae chacha! Kya tum Abu Jahl ko jante ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. Ae bhatije! Tumhe us se kya hajat hai? Us ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gali deta hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar main use dekhun to mera jism us ke jism se juda nahi hoga yahan tak ke hum mein se jaldi marne wala mar jaye. Phir mujhe is par ta'ajjub hua. Phir doosre ne mujhe kankocha. Phir us ne mujh se is jaisa kaha. Phir main ne der na ki ke main ne Abu Jahl ko logon mein ghoomte dekha. Main ne kaha: Suno! Beshak ye tum dono ka sathi hai jis ke bare mein tum ne mujh se poochha tha. Phir wo dono apni talwaron se us ki taraf daud पड़े. Phir unhon ne use mara yahan tak ke use qatl kar diya. Phir wo dono Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf laute aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kis ne use qatl kiya? Un mein se har ek ne kaha: Main ne use qatl kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni talwarein ponchhein? Un dono ne kaha: Nahi. Phir Aap ne dono talwaron mein dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum dono ne use qatl kiya. Us ka saman Muadh bin Amr bin al-Jamuh ke liye hai. Aur wo dono Muadh bin Afra aur Muadh bin Amr bin al-Jamuh they."
"1146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bani Nadir ke maal us mein se they jo Allah ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par fai farmaya, us mein se jis par Musalmanon ne ghode aur sawariyan na daudayein. Phir wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khaas they. Aur Aap apne ghar walon par saal bhar ka kharcha kharch farmate. Phir jo bachta use hathyar aur ghode mein rakhte, Allah ke raste mein tayyari ke liye."
"1147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se Malik bin Aus bin al-Hadathan al-Nasri ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne use bulaya jab un ke paas un ke darban Yarfa aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tumhe Usman, Abd al-Rahman, Zubair aur Sa'd mein raghbat hai jo ijazat mangte hain? To unhon ne kaha: Haan, unhe dakhil karo. Phir thodi der thehre. Phir aaye aur kaha: Kya tumhe Abbas aur Ali mein raghbat hai jo ijazat mangte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir jab wo dono dakhil hue to Abbas ne kaha: Amir al-Muminin! Mere aur is ke darmiyan faisla farmayiye, jabke wo dono us mein jhagadte they jo Allah ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par Bani Nadir se fai farmaya. Phir Ali aur Abbas ne ek doosre ko bura kaha. Phir jamaat ne kaha: Amir al-Muminin! Un dono ke darmiyan faisla farmayiye aur ek ko doosre se aaram dijiye. Phir Umar ne kaha: Thehro. Main tumhe Allah ki qasam deta hun jis ki ijazat se aasman aur zameen qayam hain. Kya tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum wirsa nahi dete. Jo hum ne chhora sadqa hai? Aap ne is se apni zaat ka irada farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne ye farmaya tha. Phir Umar Abbas aur Ali ki taraf mutawajjah hue. To unhon ne kaha: Main tum dono ko Allah ki qasam deta hun. Kya tum dono jante ho ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye farmaya tha? Un dono ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main tumhe is mamle ke bare mein bayan karta hun. Beshak Allah Subhanahu ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is fai mein khaas farmaya jo kisi aur ko nahi diya. Phir Jalla Zikruhu ne farmaya [aur jo Allah ne Apne Rasool par un se fai farmaya to tum ne us par ghode aur sawariyan nahi daudayein] Aap ke qaul [qadir] tak. Phir ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khaas thi. Phir, Allah ki qasam! Aap ne use tum se rok kar nahi rakha, na tum par tarjeeh se liya. Beshak Aap ne use tumhe diya aur tum mein taqseem kiya yahan tak ke is mein se ye maal baqi raha. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne ghar walon par is maal mein se un ke saal ka kharcha kharch farmate. Phir jo bachta use lete aur use Allah ke maal ki jagah rakhte. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni zindagi mein aisa kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) faut ho gaye. Phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka wali hun. Phir Abu Bakr ne use qabz kiya. Phir us mein waisa hi kiya jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiya, jabke tum us waqt... Phir Ali aur Abbas ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur kaha: Tum dono yaad karte ho ke Abu Bakr us mein tha jaisa tum kehte ho. Aur Allah janta hai ke beshak wo us mein sacha, nek, seedha, haq ki pairwi karne wala tha. Phir Allah ne Abu Bakr ko wafat di. Phir main ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr ka wali hun. Phir main ne use apni khilafat ke do saal qabz kiya. Us mein waisa hi karta jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr ne kiya. Aur Allah janta hai ke beshak main us mein sacha, nek, seedha, haq ki pairwi karne wala hun. Phir tum dono mere paas aaye jabke tum dono ki baat ek hai, tumhara mamla jama hai. Phir tum mere paas aaye [matlab Abbas]. Phir main ne tum dono se kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum wirsa nahi dete. Jo hum ne chhora sadqa hai. Phir jab mujhe zahir hua ke use tumhe de dun to main ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to main use tumhe de dun, is par ke tum par Allah ka ahad aur paiman hai ke tum dono us mein waisa hi karoge jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr ne kiya, aur jo main ne kiya jab se wali bana. Warna mujh se baat na karna. Phir tum dono ne kaha: Use hamein is par de do. Phir main ne use tumhe de diya. Phir kya tum mujh se is ke siwa faisla mangte ho? Allah ki qasam jis ki ijazat se aasman aur zameen qayam hain! Main us mein is ke siwa faisla nahi karunga yahan tak ke Qayamat qaim ho. Phir agar tum dono us se aajiz ho to use mujhe de do. Phir main tumhe kafi hunga."
"1148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon ne jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) faut ho gaye to irada kiya ke wo Usman ko Bakr ki taraf bhejein taake un se un ki miras mangein. To Aisha ne kaha: Kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nahi farmaya: Hum wirsa nahi dete. Jo hum ne chhora sadqa hai?"
"1149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti Fatima (alaihassalam) ne Abu Bakr ki taraf bheja taake un se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apni miras mangein, us mein se jo Allah ne Aap par Madina mein fai farmaya, Fadak aur Khaibar ke khums mein se jo bacha. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum wirsa nahi dete. Jo hum ne chhora sadqa hai. Beshak Aal Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is maal mein se khate hain. Aur beshak main, Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sadqe mein se koi cheez us halat se nahi badlunga jis par wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein thi. Aur main us mein zaroor waisa hi karunga jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiya. Phir Abu Bakr ne inkar kiya ke Fatima ko us mein se kuchh dein. Phir Fatima ne Abu Bakr par is mein naraazgi payi. Phir unhon ne Aap se talluq tod liya. Phir Aap se baat na ki yahan tak ke wafat pa gayein. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad chhe mahine zinda rahein. Phir jab wafat pa gayein to un ke shohar Ali ne unhe raat mein dafan kiya. Aur Abu Bakr ko un ki khabar na di. Aur un par namaz parhi. Aur Ali ke liye Fatima ki zindagi mein logon mein izzat thi. Phir jab wafat pa gayein to Ali ne logon ke chehre anjane paye. Phir Abu Bakr se sulah aur bai'at ka irada kiya, jabke Wo un mahinon mein bai'at na karte they. Phir Aap ne Abu Bakr ki taraf bheja: Hamare paas aayiye, aur tumhare sath koi na aaye [Umar ke hazir hone ko na-pasand karte hue]. Phir Umar ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tum un ke paas akele dakhil nahi hoge. Phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Wo mujh se kya karenge? Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor un ke paas aaunga. Phir Abu Bakr un ke paas dakhil hue. Phir Ali ne shahadat parhi. Phir farmaya: Beshak hum ne tumhari fazilat aur jo Allah ne tumhe diya pehchana hai. Aur hum ne tum par us bhalayi se rashk nahi kiya jo Allah ne tumhe di. Lekin tum ne hum par mamle mein istebdad kiya. Aur hum dekhte they ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se hamari rishtedari ki wajah se hamara hissa hai. Yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ki dono aankhein behne lagein. Phir jab Abu Bakr ne guftagu farmayi to farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki rishtedari mujhe apni rishtedari se jodne se zyada mehboob hai. Aur raha jo mere aur tumhare darmiyan in maalon mein se hua, main ne us mein bhalayi se kotahi nahi ki. Aur main ne koi mamla nahi chhora jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us mein karte dekha magar kiya. Phir Ali ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Tumhara wada shaam ko bai'at ka hai. Phir jab Abu Bakr ne Zuhr parhi to mimbar par chadhe aur shahadat parhi. Aur Ali ke mamle aur un ke bai'at se peechhe rehne ka zikr kiya. Aur unhe us se uzr diya jo unhon ne Aap se uzr kiya. Phir maghfirat mangi. Aur Ali ne shahadat parhi. Phir Abu Bakr ke haq ko bada bataya. Aur bayan kiya ke unhe jo kiya us par Abu Bakr se rashk ne nahi ubhara, na us ka inkar jo Allah ne unhe fazilat di. Lekin hum dekhte they ke hamara is mamle mein hissa hai. Phir hum par istebdad kiya gaya. Phir hum ne apne dilon mein paya. Phir Musalman is se khush hue. Aur unhon ne kaha: Tum ne durust kaha. Aur Musalman Ali se qareeb they jab unhon ne maroof mamle ki taraf ruju kiya."
"1150","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti Fatima (alaihassalam) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu Bakr Siddiq se sawal kiya ke wo un ki miras taqseem karein, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chhora, us mein se jo Allah ne Aap par fai farmaya. To Abu Bakr ne un se kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum wirsa nahi dete. Jo hum ne chhora sadqa hai. Phir Fatima bint Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghazab-naak huein. Phir Abu Bakr se talluq tod liya. Phir Aap se talluq tode rahein yahan tak ke wafat pa gayein. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad chhe mahine zinda rahein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Fatima Abu Bakr se apna hissa mangti thein us mein se jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar, Fadak aur Madina mein Aap ke sadqe se chhora. Phir Abu Bakr ne un par is ka inkar kiya. Aur farmaya: Main koi cheez nahi chhorunga jis par Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) amal karte they magar us par amal karunga. Kyunke mujhe dar hai ke agar main ne Aap ke mamle mein se koi cheez chhori to gumrah ho jaun. Raha Madina mein Aap ka sadqa, Umar ne use Ali aur Abbas ko de diya. Raha Khaibar aur Fadak, Umar ne unhe rok rakha. Aur farmaya: Wo dono Rasulullah ke sadqe hain. Wo Aap ke huqooq ke liye they jo Aap ko pesh aate aur museebatein. Aur un ka mamla us ke paas hai jo mamle ka wali ho. Phir wo aaj tak is par hain."
"1151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere waris deenar taqseem nahi karenge. Jo main ne chhora, meri biwiyon ke kharche aur mere karkun ke kharch ke baad, wo sadqa hai."
"1152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Najd ki taraf ghode bheje. Phir wo Bani Hanifa mein se ek shakhs lekar aaye jise Thumama bin Uthal kaha jata hai. Phir unhon ne use masjid ke sutunon mein se ek sutun se bandha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas nikle. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Thumama! Tumhare paas kya hai? To us ne kaha: Mere paas bhalayi hai ae Muhammad! Agar tum mujhe qatl karoge to khoon wale ko qatl karoge. Aur agar ehsan karoge to shukr-guzar par ehsan karoge. Aur agar tum maal chahte ho to us mein se jo chaho mango. Yahan tak ke kal thi. Phir Aap ne us se farmaya: Ae Thumama! Tumhare paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Jo main ne tum se kaha. Agar ehsan karoge to shukr-guzar par ehsan karoge. Phir use chhora yahan tak ke us se agle din thi. Phir farmaya: Ae Thumama! Tumhare paas kya hai? To us ne kaha: Mere paas jo main ne tum se kaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Thumama ko chhoro. Phir wo masjid ke qareeb khajoor ke bagh ki taraf chala aur ghusl kiya. Phir masjid mein dakhil hua. Phir us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain. Ae Muhammad! Allah ki qasam! Zameen par koi chehra tumhare chehre se zyada na-pasandeeda na tha. Phir tumhara chehra mere nazdeek chehron mein sab se mehboob ho gaya. Allah ki qasam! Koi deen tumhare deen se zyada na-pasandeeda na tha. Phir tumhara deen mere nazdeek deenon mein sab se mehboob ho gaya. Allah ki qasam! Koi sheher tumhare sheher se zyada na-pasandeeda na tha. Phir tumhara sheher mere nazdeek shehron mein sab se mehboob ho gaya. Aur beshak tumhare ghodon ne mujhe pakda jabke main umre ka irada karta tha. Phir tumhara kya khayal hai? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use khush-khabri di aur use umra ka hukm diya. Phir jab wo Makkah aaya to kehne wale ne kaha: Tum deen se phir gaye? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin main Muhammad Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath musalman hua hun. Aur nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tumhare paas Yamama se gehu ka dana nahi aayega yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us mein ijazat dein."
"1153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum masjid mein they to hamare paas Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle. To Aap ne farmaya: Yahood ki taraf chalo. Phir hum Aap ke sath nikle yahan tak ke hum Bait al-Midras aaye. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue aur unhe pukara: Ae Yahood ki jamaat! Musalman ho jao, salamti paoge. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne pahunchaya ae Abu al-Qasim! To Aap ne farmaya: Yehi chahta hun. Phir doosri martaba kaha. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne pahunchaya ae Abu al-Qasim! Phir teesri martaba kaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Jano ke zameen Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki hai. Aur beshak main tumhe nikalna chahta hun. Phir tum mein se jo apne maal mein kuchh paye wo use beche. Warna jano ke zameen Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki hai."
"1154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nadir aur Quraiza ne ladayi ki. Phir Aap ne Bani Nadir ko nikala aur Quraiza ko rakha aur un par ehsan farmaya. Yahan tak ke Quraiza ne ladayi ki. Phir un ke mardon ko qatl kiya. Aur un ki aurton, aulad aur maalon ko Musalmanon ke darmiyan taqseem kiya, siwaye un mein se kuchh ke. Wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mile. Phir Aap ne unhe aman di aur wo musalman hue. Aur Madina ke tamam Yahood ko nikala: Bani Qainuqa, jo Abdullah bin Salam ke rishtedar hain, Bani Haritha ke Yahood aur Madina ke tamam Yahood."
"1155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Bani Quraiza Sa'd ke faisle par utre, jo Ibn Muadh hain, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bheja, jabke Wo un se qareeb they. Phir Wo gadhe par aaye. Phir jab qareeb aaye to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne sardar ke liye khade ho jao. Phir Wo aaye aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baithe. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Beshak ye tumhare faisle par utre hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main faisla karta hun ke ladne wale qatl kiye jayein, aulad qaidi banayi jaye. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne un mein Badshah ke faisle se faisla kiya."
"1156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd Khandaq ke din zakhmi hue. Quraish mein se ek shakhs ne unhe mara jise Hibban bin al-Ariqa kaha jata hai. Unhe kohni ki rag mein mara. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne masjid mein khaima lagaya taake qareeb se un ki ayadat karein. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Khandaq se laute aur hathyar rakhe aur ghusl farmaya to Aap ke paas Jibreel (alaihissalam) aaye jabke Wo apne sar se ghubar jhad rahe they. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne hathyar rakh diye jabke Allah ki qasam! Main ne nahi rakhe. Un ke paas niklo. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir kahan? Phir unhon ne Bani Quraiza ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas aaye. Phir wo Aap ke faisle par utre. Phir Aap ne faisla Sa'd ki taraf phera. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main un mein faisla karta hun ke ladne wale qatl kiye jayein, aurtein aur aulad qaidi banayi jayein, aur un ke maal taqseem kiye jayein."
"1157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Sa'd ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak Tu janta hai ke mujhe un se zyada koi mehboob nahi jin se main Teri wajah se ladun, us qaum mein se jinhon ne Tere Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jhutlaya aur nikala. Ae Allah! Phir beshak main gumaan karta hun ke Tune hamare aur un ke darmiyan ladayi rakh di hai. Phir agar Quraish ki ladayi mein se kuchh baqi ho to mujhe us ke liye baqi rakh yahan tak ke main Teri wajah se un se ladun. Aur agar Tune ladayi rakh di hai to use phaad de aur meri maut us mein bana de. Phir wo us ke seene se phoot padi. Phir unhe dar na hua, jabke masjid mein Bani Ghifar ka khaima tha, magar khoon un ki taraf behta hua. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae khaime walo! Ye kya hai jo hamari taraf tumhari taraf se aata hai? Phir Sa'd they jabke un ka zakhm khoon behata tha. Phir Wo us se faut ho gaye (raziyallahu anhu)."
"1158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se farmaya jab Ahzab se laute: Koi Asr na parhe magar Bani Quraiza mein. Phir un mein se kuchh ko raste mein Asr payi. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Hum namaz nahi parhenge yahan tak ke usے aayein. Aur un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Balke hum namaz parhenge. Hum se ye nahi chaha gaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya gaya. Phir Aap ne un mein se kisi ko malamat na farmayi."
"1159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Muhajirin Makkah se Madina aaye jabke un ke hathon mein kuchh na tha, matlab koi cheez. Aur Ansar zameen aur jaidad wale they. Phir Ansar ne un se taqseem kiya ke wo unhe har saal apne maalon ke phal dein, aur unhe kaam aur kharcha kafi hon. Aur un ki walida, Anas ki walida Umm Sulaim thein, jo Abdullah bin Abi Talha ki walida thein. Phir Anas ki walida ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khajoor ke khoshe diye. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe Umm Aiman ko diya, jo Aap ki aazad-karda hain, Usama bin Zaid ki walida. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Khaibar walon ke qatl se farigh hue to Madina ki taraf laute. Phir Muhajirin ne Ansar ki taraf un ke atiye lautaye jo unhon ne unhe apne phalon mein se diye they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki walida ki taraf un ke khoshe lautaye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Umm Aiman ko apne bagh mein se un ki jagah diya."
"1160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khajoorein karta. Yahan tak ke Quraiza aur Nadir fatah hue. Aur beshak mere ghar walon ne mujhe hukm diya ke main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaun aur Aap se unhe mangun jo unhon ne Aap ko diye they ya kuchh. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use Umm Aiman ko diya tha. Phir Umm Aiman aayein aur kapda meri gardan mein dala, kehti: Hargiz nahi, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Wo unhe nahi denge jabke unhon ne mujhe diya hai, ya jaisa unhon ne kaha. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Tumhare liye itna. Aur wo kehtin: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Yahan tak ke Aap ne unhe us ka dus guna diya, ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya."
"1161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Khaibar ke qile ka muhasra kiye they. Phir ek insan ne thaili phenki jis mein charbi thi. Phir main use lene ke liye kooda. Phir main ne tawajjah ki to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) they. Phir main Aap se sharmaya."
"1162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sufyan se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Sufyan ne bayan kiya, us ke munh se mere munh tak. Unhon ne kaha: Main us muddat mein nikla jo mere aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darmiyan thi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab main Sham mein tha to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se Hiraql ke paas kitab layi gayi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Dihya Kalbi use lekar aaye they. Phir use Busra ke sardar ko diya. Phir Busra ke sardar ne use Hiraql ko diya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Hiraql ne kaha: Kya yahan is shakhs ki qaum mein se koi hai jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai? To unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Quraish ke ek giroh mein bulaya gaya. Phir hum Hiraql ke paas dakhil hue. Phir us ne hamein apne samne bithaya. Phir us ne kaha: Tum mein se kaun is shakhs se nasab mein qareeb hai jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai? Phir Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Main hun. Phir unhon ne mujhe apne samne bithaya. Aur mere sathiyon ko mere peechhe bithaya. Phir us ne apne tarjuman ko bulaya. Phir us ne kaha: Un se kaho: Beshak main is se is shakhs ke bare mein poochhne wala hun jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai. Phir agar wo mujh se jhoot bole to use jhutlao. Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar mujh par jhoot ki tohmat ka dar na hota to main jhoot bolta. Phir us ne apne tarjuman se kaha: Us se poochho ke us ka hasab tum mein kaisa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo hum mein hasab wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: Kya us ke baapon mein badshah tha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Phir kya tum usے jhoot se muttaham karte they is se pehle ke wo kahe jo us ne kaha? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Us ki pairwi logon ke shareef karte hain ya kamzor? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Balke kamzor. Unhon ne kaha: Wo badhte hain ya kam hote hain? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi, balke badhte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Kya un mein se koi apne deen se phirta hai us mein dakhil hone ke baad us se naraz hokar? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir kya tum ne us se ladayi ki? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us se tumhari ladayi kaisi thi? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Hamare aur us ke darmiyan ladayi dol jaisi hoti hai. Wo hum se pata hai aur hum us se pate hain. Unhon ne kaha: Kya wo ahad-shikani karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Aur hum us se is muddat mein hain, hum nahi jante wo us mein kya karne wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mujhe koi kalima na mil saka jis mein main kuchh dakhil karun is ke siwa. Unhon ne kaha: Phir kya is qaul ko us se pehle kisi ne kaha? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Phir us ne apne tarjuman se kaha: Us se kaho: Beshak main ne tum se us ke hasab ke bare mein poochha. Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke wo tum mein hasab wala hai. Aur Rasool aise hi bheje jate hain apni qaum ke hasab mein. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya us ke baapon mein badshah tha? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke nahi. Phir main ne kaha ke agar us ke baapon mein badshah hota to kehta ke wo shakhs apne baapon ki badshahi mangta hai. Aur main ne tum se us ke pairwkaron ke bare mein poochha, un ke kamzor ya shareef? Phir tum ne kaha balke un ke kamzor. Aur wo Rasoolon ke pairwkar hain. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya tum usے jhoot se muttaham karte they is se pehle ke wo kahe jo us ne kaha? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke nahi. Phir main ne jana ke wo logon par jhoot chhor kar Allah par jhoot nahi bolega. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya un mein se koi apne deen se phirta hai us mein dakhil hone ke baad us se naraz hokar? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke nahi. Aur iman aisa hi hai jab dilon ki khushi se mile. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya wo badhte hain ya kam hote hain? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke wo badhte hain. Aur iman aisa hi hai yahan tak ke poora ho. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya tum ne us se ladayi ki? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke tum ne us se ladayi ki. Phir tumhare aur us ke darmiyan ladayi dol jaisi hoti hai. Wo tum se pata hai aur tum us se pate ho. Aur Rasool aise hi aazmaye jate hain phir un ke liye anjam hota hai. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya wo ahad-shikani karta hai? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke wo ahad-shikani nahi karta. Aur Rasool aise hi ahad-shikani nahi karte. Aur main ne tum se poochha ke kya ye qaul us se pehle kisi ne kaha? Phir tum ne dawa kiya ke nahi. Phir main ne kaha ke agar ye qaul us se pehle kisi ne kaha hota to kehta ke wo shakhs us qaul ki pairwi karta hai jo us se pehle kaha gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne kaha: Wo tumhe kis ka hukm deta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo hamein namaz, zakat, sila-rahmi aur paak-damani ka hukm deta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Agar jo tum kehte ho us mein haq hai to beshak wo Nabi hai. Aur beshak main janta tha ke wo nikalne wala hai. Aur main na gumaan karta tha ke wo tum mein se hoga. Aur agar main janta ke main us tak khalis hunga to us se mulaqat ko pasand karta. Aur agar main us ke paas hota to us ke qadmon ko dhota. Aur us ki badshahi mere dono qadmon ke neeche tak pahunchegi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki kitab mangwayi aur use parha. Phir us mein tha: Allah ke naam se jo bada meharban rehem wala hai. Muhammad Rasulullah ki taraf se Hiraql Room ke azeem ki taraf. Salam us par jo hidayat ki pairwi kare. Amma ba'd! Phir beshak main tumhe Islam ki dawat se bulata hun. Musalman ho jao, salamti paoge. Aur musalman ho jao, Allah tumhe tumhara ajr do martaba dega. Phir agar tum phire to beshak tum par kashtkaron ka gunah hai [aur Ahle Kitab! Aao us kalime ki taraf jo hamare aur tumhare darmiyan barabar hai ke hum Allah ke siwa ibadat na karein] Aap ke qaul [gawahi do ke hum musalman hain] tak. Phir jab wo kitab parhne se farigh hua to us ke paas awazein buland huein aur shor zyada hua. Aur hamare liye hukm diya gaya aur hum nikal diye gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne apne sathiyon se kaha jab hum nikle: Ibn Abi Kabsha ka mamla badh gaya hai. Beshak us se Bani Asfar ka badshah darta hai. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mamle se yaqeen rakhta raha ke Wo ghalib aayenge yahan tak ke Allah ne mujh par Islam dakhil farmaya."
"1163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se ek shakhs ne poochha: Kya tum Hunain ke din bhage they, ae Abu Umara? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne peeth nahi pheri. Lekin Aap ke sathiyon ke naujawan aur halke nange baghair hathyar ke nikle. Phir wo teer-andaz qaum ke paas aaye, Hawazin aur Bani Nasr ki jamaat, un ka teer mushkil se girta tha. Phir unhon ne unhe aise mara ke mushkil se khata karte. Phir wo wahan se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf aaye, jabke Wo apne safed khachchar par they aur Aap ke chacha-zaad bhai Abu Sufyan bin al-Harith bin Abd al-Muttalib Aap ko lekar chal rahe they. Phir Aap utre aur madad mangi. Phir farmaya: Main Nabi hun, jhoot nahi. Main Abd al-Muttalib ka beta hun. Phir Aap ne apne sathiyon ko saf bandhi."
"1164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se Qais mein se ek shakhs ne poochha: Kya tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Hunain ke din bhage? To unhon ne kaha: Lekin Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nahi bhage. Hawazin teer-andaz they. Aur jab hum ne un par hamla kiya to wo phail gaye. Phir hum ghaneematon par toot pade. Phir hamara teeron se istiqbal kiya gaya. Aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apne safed khachchar par dekha, jabke Abu Sufyan us ki lagam pakde they. Aur Wo farma rahe they: Main Nabi hun, jhoot nahi."
"1165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Taif ka muhasra kiya aur un se kuchh na paya to farmaya: Beshak hum lautne wale hain agar Allah ne chaha. Phir un par bhari guzra. Aur unhon ne kaha: Hum jayein aur use fatah na karein? Aur ek martaba farmaya: Hum laut-te hain. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Subah ladayi par jao. Phir wo subah gaye. Phir unhe zakhm lage. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak hum kal lautne wale hain agar Allah ne chaha. Phir unhe pasand aaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hanse."
"1166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makkah dakhil hue jabke Kaaba ke ird-gird teen sau saath but they. Phir Aap unhe apne hath ki chhadi se kuredne lage. Aur farmane lage: [Haq aaya aur batil mit gaya] ayat tak."
"1167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hudaibiya walon se sulah ki to Ali ne un ke darmiyan kitab likhi. Phir likha: Muhammad Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Phir mushrikon ne kaha: Muhammad Rasulullah na likho. Agar tum Rasool hote to hum tum se na ladte. Phir Aap ne Ali se farmaya: Use mitao. To Ali ne kaha: Main wo nahi hun jo use mitaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apne hath se mitaya. Aur un se sulah ki ke Wo aur Aap ke sahaba teen din dakhil hon. Aur use hathyar ke khol ke siwa dakhil na hon. Phir unhon ne Aap se poochha: Hathyar ka khol kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Thaili jo us mein hai."
"1168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Hunaif se Abu Wail ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Siffin mein they. Phir Sahl bin Hunaif khade hue. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae logon! Apne aap ko muttaham karo. Kyunke hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Hudaibiya ke din they. Aur agar hum ladayi dekhte to ladte. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hum haq par nahi aur wo batil par? To Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya hamare maqtool Jannat mein nahi aur un ke maqtool Dozakh mein? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum apne deen mein zillat kyun dein? Kya hum lautein jabke Allah ne hamare aur un ke darmiyan faisla nahi farmaya? To Aap ne farmaya: Ibn al-Khattab! Beshak main Allah ka Rasool hun aur Allah mujhe kabhi zaya nahi farmayega. Phir Umar Abu Bakr ke paas chale. Phir unhon ne un se waisa hi kaha jaisa Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha tha. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak Wo Allah ke Rasool hain aur Allah unhe kabhi zaya nahi farmayega. Phir Surah Fath nazil hui. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use Umar ko aakhir tak parh kar sunayi. Phir Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya wo fatah hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"1169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Uhud ke din zakhm ke bare mein poochha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra zakhmi hua, Aap ki chauphad toot gayi, Aap ke sar par khud toot gaya. Phir Fatima (alaihassalam) khoon dhoti thein aur Ali pakde they. Phir jab unhon ne dekha ke khoon zyadati ke siwa nahi badhta to unhon ne chatai li aur use jalaya yahan tak ke raakh ho gayi. Phir use lagaya. Phir khoon ruk gaya."
"1170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Goya main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekh raha hun ke Wo Ambiya mein se ek Nabi ka qissa bayan kar rahe hain, un ki qaum ne unhe mara aur khoon-aalood kiya, jabke Wo apne chehre se khoon ponchhte hain aur farmate hain: [Ae Allah! Meri qaum ko bakhsh de, kyunke wo nahi jante]."
"1171","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ka ghazab sakht hua us qaum par jinhon ne apne Nabi se aisa kiya, Aap apni chauphad ki taraf ishara farmate. Allah ka ghazab sakht hua us shakhs par jise Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Allah ke raste mein qatl karein."
"1172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Baitullah ke paas namaz parh rahe they, jabke Abu Jahl aur us ke sathi baithe they. Jab un mein se ek ne doosre se kaha: Tum mein se kaun Falan ke oont ki ojhdi layega aur use Muhammad ki peeth par rakhega jab Wo sajda karein? Phir qaum ka bad-bakht utha aur use laya. Phir dekha yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sajda kiya to use Aap ki peeth par dono kandhon ke darmiyan rakha, jabke main dekh raha tha aur kuchh badal na sakta tha. Agar mere paas taqat hoti. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo hanne lage aur ek doosre par girne lage, jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sajde mein they aur apna sar na uthate they, yahan tak ke un ke paas Fatima aayein. Phir unhon ne Aap ki peeth se phenka. Phir Aap ne apna sar uthaya. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Tum Quraish ko pakdo, teen martaba. Phir un par bhari guzra jab Aap ne un par bad-dua ki. Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo dekhte they ke dua us sheher mein qubool hoti hai. Phir naam liye: Ae Allah! Tum Abu Jahl ko pakdo. Aur tum par Utba bin Rabi'a, Shaiba bin Rabi'a, Walid bin Utba, Umayya bin Khalaf, Uqba bin Abi Mu'ait. Aur saatwein ko gina to unhon ne yaad na rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne unhe dekha jinhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne gina tha, kunwein mein pade hue, Badr ke kunwein mein."
"1173","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Kya tum par koi din aaya jo Uhud ke din se sakht tha? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhari qaum se jo paya paya. Aur jo sab se sakht main ne un se paya Aqaba ka din tha, jab main ne apne aap ko Ibn Abd Yalil bin Abd Kulal par pesh kiya. Phir us ne mujhe wo jawab na diya jo main chahta tha. Phir main chala jabke main apne chehre par ghamgeen tha. Phir main hosh mein na aaya magar Qarn al-Tha'alib mein tha. Phir main ne apna sar uthaya. Phir main badal se tha jis ne mujh par saya kiya tha. Phir main ne dekha to us mein Jibreel they. Phir unhon ne mujhe pukara. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne tumhari qaum ka tumhe qaul aur jo unhon ne tumhe jawab diya suna hai. Aur beshak Us ne tumhari taraf pahadon ka farishta bheja hai taake tum use un mein jo chaho hukm do. Phir pahadon ke farishte ne mujhe pukara aur mujhe salam kiya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Phir Aap ne farmaya us mein jo chaho: Agar un par Akhshabain mila dun? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Balke main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah un ki pushton se use nikale jo Allah Wahdahu ki ibadat kare, Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na kare."
"1174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kuchh mashahid mein they, jabke Aap ki ungli khoon-aalood hui thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ungli ke siwa kya ho jo khoon-aalood hui, aur Allah ke raste mein jo paya?"
"1175","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemar hue. Phir do ya teen raatein qayam na farmaya. Phir ek aurat aayi. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Beshak main ummeed rakhti hun ke tumhara shaitan tumhe chhor gaya hai. Main ne use do ya teen raaton se tumhare qareeb nahi dekha. Phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ye nazil farmaya [aur chasht aur raat jab chha jaye, tumhare Rab ne tumhe nahi chhora aur na naraaz hua]."
"1176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) gadhe par sawar hue jis par kathi thi, us ke neeche Fadak ki qateefa thi. Aur Usama bin Zaid ko apne peechhe sawar kiya, jabke Wo Bani Harith bin al-Khazraj mein Sa'd bin Ubada ki ayadat kar rahe they. Aur ye Badr ki ladayi se pehle tha. Yahan tak ke ek majlis se guzre jis mein Musalmanon, mushrikon, buton ke pujariyon aur Yahood ke milay-julay they. Aur un mein Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul tha. Aur majlis mein Abdullah bin Rawaha they. Phir jab sawari ki ghubar ne majlis ko ghera to Abdullah bin Ubayy ne apni chadar se apni naak dhanpi. Phir us ne kaha: Hum par ghubar na udao. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe salam kiya. Phir thehre aur utre. Phir unhe Allah ki taraf bulaya aur unhe Quran parh kar sunaya. Phir Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul ne kaha: Ae shakhs! Is se behtar kuchh nahi. Agar jo tum kehte ho haq hai to hamari majlison mein hamein takleef na do. Apne rehal ki taraf lauto. Phir jo hamare paas tumhare paas aaye use qissa sunao. Ibn Rawaha ne kaha: Hamari majlison mein hamare paas aao, kyunke hum ise pasand karte hain. Phir Musalman, mushrik aur Yahood gali dene lage yahan tak ke ladne ka irada kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhe narm karte rahe. Phir Apni sawari par sawar hue yahan tak ke Sa'd bin Ubada ke paas dakhil hue. Phir farmaya: Ae Sa'd! Kya tum ne nahi suna jo Abu Hubab ne kaha? Matlab Abdullah bin Ubayy. Us ne aisa aur aisa kaha. Unhon ne kaha: Us se darguzar farmayiye Ya Rasulullah! Aur muaf farmayiye. Allah ki qasam! Beshak Allah ne tumhe... [aur hadith mein baqi hissa hai]."
"1177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha gaya: Kash tum Abdullah bin Ubayy ke paas aate? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas chale aur gadhe par sawar hue. Phir Musalman Aap ke sath paidal chale, jo khari zameen thi. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas aaye to us ne kaha: Mujh se door ho jao. Allah ki qasam! Tumhare gadhe ki boo ne mujhe takleef di hai. Phir Ansar mein se ek mard ne un mein se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka gadha tum se zyada achhi khushboo wala hai. Phir Abdullah ke liye us ki qaum mein se ek mard ghazab-naak hua aur dono ne gali di. Phir un mein se har ek ke sathiyon ko ghussa aaya. Phir un ke darmiyan khajoor ki tehniyon, hathon aur jootiyon se maar hui. Phir hamein khabar pahunchi ke ye nazil hui [aur agar mominon ke do giroh ladein to un dono ke darmiyan sulah karo]."
"1178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Badr ke din farmaya: Kaun dekhega ke Abu Jahl ne kya kiya? Phir Ibn Mas'ud chale. Phir unhon ne use paya ke use Afra ke dono beton ne mara tha yahan tak ke thanda ho gaya tha. Phir unhon ne us ki dadhi pakdi. Phir farmaya: Tum Abu Jahl ho? Us ne kaha: Aur us shakhs se upar kaun hai jise us ki qaum ne qatl kiya? Ya kaha: Tum ne use qatl kiya?"
"1179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kaun Ka'b bin al-Ashraf ke liye hai? Kyunke us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ko takleef di hai. Phir Muhammad bin Maslama khade hue. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum pasand karte ho ke main use qatl karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe ijazat dijiye ke main koi baat kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. Phir Muhammad bin Maslama us ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak is shakhs ne hum se sadqa manga hai. Aur beshak us ne hamein takleef di hai. Aur beshak main tumhare paas aaya hun taake tum se udhaar mangun. Us ne kaha: Aur bhi. Allah ki qasam! Tum us se ukta jaoge. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak hum ne us ki pairwi ki hai. Phir hum pasand nahi karte ke use chhorein yahan tak ke dekhein ke us ka mamla kis taraf hota hai. Aur beshak hum ne irada kiya hai ke tum hamein ek ya do wasaq udhaar do. To us ne kaha: Haan. Mujhe girwi rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Tum kya chahte ho? Us ne kaha: Mujhe apni aurtein girwi rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tumhe apni aurtein kaise girwi rakhein jabke tum Arab mein sab se haseen ho? Us ne kaha: Phir mujhe apne bete girwi rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tumhe apne bete kaise girwi rakhein? Phir un mein se ek ko bura kaha jayega aur kaha jayega ke ek ya do wasaq par girwi rakha gaya. Ye hum par aar hai. Lekin hum tumhe hathyar girwi rakhte hain [matlab hathyar]. Phir us ne us se wada kiya ke us ke paas aayenge. Phir wo raat mein us ke paas aaye jabke us ke sath Abu Naila they, jo doodh mein Ka'b ke bhai they. Phir unhon ne unhe qile ki taraf bulaya. Phir wo un ki taraf utra. Phir us ki biwi ne us se kaha: Is ghadi tum kahan nikalte ho? To us ne kaha: Wo to Muhammad bin Maslama aur mera bhai Abu Naila hain. Unhon ne kaha: Main aisi awaz sunti hun goya us se khoon tapak raha hai. Us ne kaha: Wo to mera bhai Muhammad bin Maslama aur mera doodh-bhai Abu Naila hain. Beshak kareem ko raat mein pukara jaye to jawab de [aur hadith mein qatl ka baqi hissa hai]."
"1180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar par hamla kiya. Phir hum ne us ke paas andhere mein Fajr ki namaz parhi. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawar hue. Abu Talha sawar hue aur main Abu Talha ke peechhe sawar tha. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ki gali mein daud lagayi jabke mera ghutna Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan ko chhu raha tha. Phir Aap ne tehband apni raan se hataya yahan tak ke main Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan ki safedi dekh raha tha. Phir jab Aap basti mein dakhil hue to farmaya: Allahu Akbar! Khaibar kharab hua. Beshak jab hum kisi qaum ke maidan mein utarte hain to daraye gayon ki subah buri hoti hai. Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur qaum apne kaamon ki taraf nikli. Phir unhon ne kaha: Muhammad aur lashkar [matlab fauj]. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne use zabardasti paya."
"1181","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Khaibar ki taraf nikle. Phir hum raat mein chale. Phir qaum mein se ek shakhs ne Amir se kaha: Ae Amir! Kya tum hamein apni nazmon mein se nahi sunaoge? Aur Amir shayar mard they. Phir wo utre aur qaum ko hanka dete hue kehte: Ae Allah! Agar Tu na hota to hum hidayat na pate, na sadqa karte na namaz parhte. Phir bakhsh de, Tum par fida, jo hum ne baqi rakha. Aur qadmon ko sabit rakh agar hum milein. Aur hum par sukoon dal. Beshak jab hamein pukara jaye to hum inkar karte hain. Aur cheekhne se hum par bharosa karte hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye hankane wala kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Amir bin al-Akwa. Aap ne farmaya: Allah us par rehem farmaye. Qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Wajib ho gayi Ya Nabiullah! Kash tum hamein us se faida dete. Phir hum Khaibar aaye aur un ka muhasra kiya yahan tak ke hamein sakht bhook lagi. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne use un par fatah farmaya. Phir jab log us din ki shaam mein they jis din un par fatah hui to unhon ne bahut si aagein jalayein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye aagein kaisi hain? Kis cheez par jalate ho? Unhon ne kaha: Gosht par. Aap ne farmaya: Kis gosht par? Unhon ne kaha: Paltu gadhon ka gosht. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use bahao aur todo. Phir ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ya hum use bahayein aur dhoyein? Aap ne farmaya: Ya wo. Phir jab qaum saf bandhe to Amir ki talwar chhoti thi. Phir us ne us se Yahoodi ki pindli ko mara taake use mare. Aur us ki talwar ka phal lauta. Phir use laga [aur hadith mein Amir ki shahadat ka baqi hissa hai]."
"1182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Ahzab ke din mitti uthate dekha, jabke mitti ne Aap ke pet ki safedi ko dhanp diya tha. Jabke Wo farma rahe they: Agar Tu na hota to hum hidayat na pate, na sadqa karte na namaz parhte. Phir hum par sukoon nazil farma. Aur qadmon ko sabit rakh agar hum milein. Beshak pehle walon ne hum par zulm kiya hai. Jab wo fitna chahte hain to hum inkar karte hain."
"1183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas aaye jabke hum khandaq khod rahe they aur apne kandhon par mitti utha rahe they. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Zindagi sirf Aakhirat ki zindagi hai. Phir Muhajirin aur Ansar ko bakhsh de."
"1184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zindagi sirf Aakhirat ki zindagi hai. Phir Ansar aur Muhajira ko durust farma."
"1185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar Khandaq ke din kehti thein: Hum hain jinhon ne Muhammad se bai'at ki. Jihad par jab tak hum zinda rahein, hamesha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe jawab diya. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Zindagi sirf Aakhirat ki zindagi hai. Phir Ansar aur Muhajira ko izzat de."
"1186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main pehli azan se pehle nikla. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki doodh wali oontniyan Dhu Qarad mein char rahi thein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe Abd al-Rahman bin Auf ka ladka mila. Phir us ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki doodh wali oontniyan pakdi gayein. Main ne kaha: Kis ne unhe pakda? Us ne kaha: Ghatfan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne teen cheekhein marein: Subah ki museebat! Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Madina ke dono kinaron ke darmiyan sunaya. Phir main apne chehre par dauda yahan tak ke unhe paya jabke wo pani se pani pila rahe they. Phir main unhe apne teeron se marne laga, jabke main teer-andaz tha. Aur kehta: Main Ibn al-Akwa hun. Aaj doodh peete bachchon ka din hai. Aur rajaz parhta yahan tak ke un se oontniyan bachayein, aur un se tees chadarein chheenein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur log aaye. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Nabiullah! Beshak main ne qaum ko pani se rok diya hai jabke wo pyase hain. Phir un ki taraf abhi bhejo. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn al-Akwa! Tum malik ho gaye to narmi karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum laute. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe apni oontni par peechhe sawar karte, yahan tak ke hum Madina dakhil hue."
"1187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Uhud ka din tha to log Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bhag gaye. Aur Abu Talha Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne they, Aap ko apni dhal se bachate hue. Aur Abu Talha sakht kaman wale teer-andaz mard they. Us din do ya teen kamanen todtein. Aur aadmi teeron ke tarqash ke sath guzarta. To Aap farmate: Use Abu Talha ke liye bichhao. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) qaum ki taraf dekhne ke liye chadhe. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Ya Nabiullah! Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon. Na chadhein. Tumhe qaum ke teeron mein se teer lagega. Mera seena tumhare seene se pehle hai. Aur beshak main ne Abu Bakr ki beti Aisha aur Umm Sulaim ko dekha, jabke wo dono kapde upar kiye thein. Main un ki pindliyon ke zewar dekhta hun. Wo apni peethon par mashkeeze uthaye laati thein. Unhe qaum ke munhon mein undelteen. Phir laut-teen aur unhe bharteen. Phir aatin aur unhe qaum ke munhon mein undelteen. Aur Abu Talha ke hathon se talwar giri, do martaba ya teen martaba."
"1188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Yazid al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo nikle, aur un ke sath Bara bin Azib aur Zaid bin Arqam nikle. Phir barish mangi. Phir Aap ne unhe apne paon par khade hokar, mimbar ke baghair, barish mangwayi. Phir maghfirat mangi phir do rakatein parhein, qiraat buland awaz se, azan na kahi na iqamat."
"1189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam se Abu Ishaq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Zaid bin Arqam ke pehlu mein tha. Phir un se kaha gaya: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kitni ladaiyan ladein? Unhon ne kaha: Unnees. Kaha gaya: Tum ne Aap ke sath kitni ladein? Unhon ne kaha: Satrah. Main ne kaha: Phir un mein se pehli kaun si thi? Unhon ne kaha: Usaira ya Ushair."
"1190","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath solah ladaiyan ladein."
"1191","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath saat ladaiyan ladein. Aur un lashkaron mein nikla jo Aap bhejte nau ladaiyon mein: Ek martaba hum par Abu Bakr, ek martaba hum par Usama."
"1192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek ladayi mein nikle, jabke hum chhe afrad they, hamare darmiyan oont tha jis par hum bari-bari sawar hote. Phir hamare paon phat gaye. Aur mere dono paon phat gaye. Aur mere nakhun gir gaye. Aur hum apne paon par kapde lapette they. Phir usے Dhat al-Riqa ki ladayi kaha gaya, us se jo hum apne paon par kapdon ki patti bandhte they. Aur Abu Musa ne isے bayan kiya. Phir usے na-pasand kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Main kya karunga ke use zikr karun? Goya unhon ne na-pasand kiya ke un ke amal mein se koi cheez faash ho."
